<Base title="Privacy" description="What the site stores." path="/privacy/">
  <main class="wrap section">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>The public site does not use tracking cookies. Guide submission stores a nickname and the steps. Email is optional and deleted 30 days after the editor finishes. The IP address is stored only as a hash and deleted after 7 days. The birth month and year stay in the browser and are not saved.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
